---
title: Avocado Toast
description: Crunchy sourdough, smashed avocado, and a chili-lemon hit.
source: https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Avocado_on_Toast_-_Cadence_Clubhouse,_Newhaven_Fort_2025-05-06.jpg
image credit: Cadence Clubhouse, Newhaven Fort (CC0) / Smashed Avocado - M&S cafe (CC0)
tags: breakfast, vegetarian, quick
time required: 10 minutes
servings: 2
---

= Prep =

Peel and stone @avocado{2} and smash it coarsely with a #fork{} in a #bowl{}.

Season with @sea salt{1/2%tsp}, @black pepper{2%pinch}, and @lemon juice{2%tsp}.

= Toast =

Toast 2 slices of @sourdough bread{} until golden (~{3%min}) — don't skimp
on the crunch, it's the whole point.

Spread the smashed avocado thickly on top and finish with @chili flakes{1%pinch}
and @olive oil{2%tsp}.
